{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SPACE HOLE is a bite sized arcade game where you grow a tail of energy and deposit it into the SPACE HOLE while avoiding enemies and obstacles. Dunking large amounts of energy into the SPACE HOLE will net you a point multiplier, but the more points you have will bring about more challenge -- so act fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This simple game expects no more than a minute or two of the player's time for a round. Try to beat your high score and earn bragging rights by topping the Steam Leaderboards, while enjoying a reactive music track from James Bennett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a Mouse, a keyboard, or (preferably) a gamepad for this classic two button arcade game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822870?t=1750183886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822870/796d0dbe428a78c1e29d9f6e2fb637a3571ae7b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750183886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822870/4aba963504e8641869f89a51034650be382a3b45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750183886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822870/4aba963504e8641869f89a51034650be382a3b45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750183886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SPACE HOLE is a bite sized arcade game where you grow a tail of energy and deposit it into the SPACE HOLE while avoiding enemies and obstacles. Dunking large amounts of energy into the SPACE HOLE will net you a point multiplier, but the more points you have will bring about more challenge -- so act fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This simple game expects no more than a minute or two of the player's time for a round. Try to beat your high score and earn bragging rights by topping the Steam Leaderboards, while enjoying a reactive music track from James Bennett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a Mouse, a keyboard, or (preferably) a gamepad for this classic two button arcade game.</p>","developers":["Fred Wood"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822870/f65039d5b82edaada10f23afcab56d4b63945d18/header.jpg?t=1750183886","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"SPACE HOLE \u00a9\ufe0f 2025 FRED WOOD","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157139,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157139/movie480.mp4?t=1750183884","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157139/movie_max.mp4?t=1750183884"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157139/064ccd4eeea5cc6fa7c3bfcdb4b2ba019478df8d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750183884","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157139/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750183884","max":"